## Source Repository Reference

### netconf-polt

NETCONF/YANG server for BCM6862x/6865x PON OLT.

| Subdir | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `netconf_server/` | NETCONF modules, YANG callbacks, DbgCli, sysrepo integration |
| `netconf_server/modules/bbf-xpon/` | BBF XPON YANG module implementations |
| `onu_mgmt/` | ONU management (embedded OMCI, vOMCI/TR-451) |
| `balapi/` | Broadcom OLT API wrappers |
| `daemon/` | Supporting daemons |
| `third_party/yang-models/` | Bundled TR-383/385/451 YANG |

Key binary: `bcmolt_netconf_server`.

### xpon-apps

Core XPON user-space applications (CMake).

| Subdir | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `protocol-handler/` | DHCPv4/v6 relay, PPPoE, protocol handling |
| `node-mgr/` | Node management |
| `event-monitor/` | System event monitoring |
| `metrics-mgr/` | Metrics collection |
| `logsvr/` | Logging server |
| `swmgr/` | Software management |
| `callhome/` | Call-home functionality |
| `notif-mgr/` | Notification management |
| `lldp-ctlr/`, `led-mgr/`, `lag/`, `hwmon/` | Platform/network utilities |

### xpon-libs

Shared libraries used by xpon-apps and netconf-polt.

| Subdir | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `ipc/` | Inter-process communication |
| `redis/` | Redis session/storage helpers |
| `log/` | Logging utilities |
| `timer/`, `taskman/` | Scheduling and task management |
| `utils/` | Common helpers |
| `dpl/` | Data plane library abstractions |

### xpon-protos

Protocol buffer and gRPC service definitions; generates C/C++ stubs under `proto/`. Changes here require rebuilding dependents (`xpon-apps`, `netconf-polt`).

### xpon-yang

Authoritative YANG models for XPON (`yang/bbf/`, `yang/ietf/`, `yang/exs1610/`). YANG changes flow: edit here → rebuild `xpon-yang` → reinstall modules → update netconf-polt handlers.

### sw-bcm686olt (read-only)

Broadcom BAL SDK and host driver. **IDE/clangd root**: `release/`. Contains `host_driver/`, `switch_sdk/`, BAL API. **Do not modify** — read only to understand chip/driver behavior; implement OLT/PON logic in `netconf-polt/balapi`.

### libyang (read-only)

Upstream YANG parser/validator (CESNET). **Do not modify** — read only to understand parsing/validation; model changes go in `xpon-yang`, integration in `netconf-polt`.

### sysrepo (read-only)

Upstream YANG configuration datastore. **Do not modify** — read only to understand datastore/plugin behavior; usage and callbacks live in `netconf-polt`.

